{"title":"Council of Solace/Open Meeting","startsAt":"2026-10-13T19:00:00-04:00","endsAt":"2026-10-13T21:30:00-04:00","status":"ACTIVE","type":"PHYSICAL","description":"Toronto Lodge invites you to join us for:\n7:00 p.m. Council of Solace\n7:30 p.m. Open Meeting\n**Topic:** “Journey & Destination,” by Johan Arnesson, *Rosicrucian Beacon*, June 2023, Vol. 32, No. 3.\nDestinations can be sweet, the accomplishment pure, and the mountaineering spirit challenged if we understand the purpose of the journey and its value to us. It is a part of the reward for coming this far. We can climb the mountain and peer over the ridge with a sense of satisfaction. We can take time to reflect and determine the course of the next chapter, for the triumph of reaching the destination is but the prelude to another.\nBoth of these events are open to the public.\nMembers are asked to please bring active membership credentials.\nLocation:\n7:00 p.m. Council of Solace - Toronto Lodge, 831 Broadview Avenue, Toronto, ON\n7:30 p.m. Open Meeting - Rosicrucian Cultural Center, 835 Broadview Avenue, Toronto, ON","venue":{"address":""},"fee":null,"group":"Rosicrucians in Toronto","image":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/e/4/d/2/highres_536278578.jpeg"}